      "writtenOn": "2017-06-01T17:27:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "the g2f_individual_keypair() function invokes dcrypto key ladder operations which in turn will call dcrypto_grab_sha_hw() before doing the actual operations (as other operations in chip/g/dcrypto/key_ladder.c) and bails out if not available. Thus we should end up returning SW_WTF+3 in this case.\nthe patch for the key ladder operations for this is not fully ready/cleaned as I haven\u0027t solved yet the bug where I have to call the keyladder derivation operations a \u0027dummy\u0027 time at board init else the step 38 later fails when invoked through this method.",
      "parentUuid": "6dcc625b_e5b49f4f",
      "revId": "fc2384c504b0cdc5a0fdefbbfb79365b3cdc72e4",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
